{
 "id": 1762601,
 "titulo": "7/6 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1657008937341,
 "modificada": 1775155346350,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1762601",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996772072\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bcf8811c751b48bb94a22ca850fc95a1_1656996772072_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThis July, in celebration of the premiere of Marvel Studios’ Thor: Love and Thunder,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">we have prepared an update full of Super Heroes and Super Villains inspired by the film!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thor, Thor (Jane Foster), and Valkyrie are receiving <strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">new Uniforms</span></strong>.<br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">6 new Artifacts</span></strong> for the Asgardian warriors,&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>Potential Awakening and Transcendence</strong></span> of Angela, Destroyer, and Skurge,<br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-3 Advancement</span></strong> <strong>for Thor (Jane Foster)</strong>,<br>\nand last but not least, <strong>Thor will be advancing to</strong> <strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span></strong>!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Do not miss out on the opportunity to fight against Gorr the God Butcher&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">in the upcoming <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>Legendary Battle: New Asgard's Destiny</strong></span>!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Challenge yourself to <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>climb up the ranks of Multiverse Invasion</strong></span> and&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">gather items for <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>the new collection added to the S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive </strong></span>with the newly updated heroes!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please check out the details below.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Three New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Uniforms have arrived, inspired by MARVEL Studios’ Thor: Love and Thunder.</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* Please note that the skill effects for the following Uniforms are as follows.<br>\n- Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10<br>\n- Other heroes: Lv. 6<br>\n* The three new uniforms will be on a </span><span style=\"color:#27ae60;\">40% off discount during the &lt;New Update Celebration Event!&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;and can be purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform menu after the event.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996794769\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d62da0a92f6b4f45afc39f10699097bd_1656996794769_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996804837\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/67d5526c23fe4234b431e721ba34be0a_1656996804837_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996821498\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ae9cfefb4cf343c089d8a0cf4ee90b2d_1656996821498_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Thor (Jane Foster) Tier-3 Advancement &amp; Ultimate Skill</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the power of thunder wielded by Thor (Jane Foster),&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">who is advancing to Tier-3 and receiving a new Ultimate Skill.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996847685\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e1646c5a8a2847719e87e587fbce54b5_1656996847685_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996857011\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/4a48f102322f4183b8ecb569600c121f_1656996857011.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Angela, Skurge, &amp; Destroyer Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence will be added for&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Angela, Skurge, and Destroyer through the July Update.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996886527\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d01efb58c9204f8992d1d15606d49092_1656996886527_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996900692\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/208db9c5bc1149b3bbddc71109c9dfb3_1656996900692.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996916830\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/479cb7ec3e7f4cbc8069df90b17ed8ec_1656996916830.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996934688\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/5f7f8e22fb66430a9730417b38c4a282_1656996934688.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Thor Tier-4 Advancement &amp; Striker Skill</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thor will be advancing to Tier-4 Advancement and a new Striker Skill will be added.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Feel the true power of Thunder with Asgard’s Protector.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Striker Skill stats are based on skill level 1.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996963573\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/634f73588ef94ebfb31087e5268665d8_1656996963573_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Addition of Legendary Battle - Thor: Love and Thunder</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Try out the new Legendary Battle - Thor: Love and Thunder and receive various rewards!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Enter the third stage, ‘A Mighty Arrival’, to acquire a Rank 6★ Thor (Jane Foster).</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996991446\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a269377d346549fc82a755fa030090c7_1656996991446_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Thor (Jane Foster) is only available when you possess her below 6★.<br>\n- The 6★ Thor (Jane Foster) can only be acquired once upon entering the stage.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Please check other Legendary Battles to make sure you have received all the other hero rewards.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Thor: Love and Thunder Extreme is only available after purchase.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997013969\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/69e574fe74f64a83af663eaa39c16ee1_1656997013969_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Please note that Crystal spent for Legendary Battle Extreme may not be subject to refund&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; due to its effects being applied immediately after purchase.<br>\n- Purchasing Legendary Battle Extreme will allow you to enter the mode indefinitely.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Special deals are offered to certain Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1657008239888\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/93e8f592d9164d0cb225936b0b3abd8f_1657008239888_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- The pop up screen will only be displayed for Agents who are eligible to purchase the product.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. There are three stages in&nbsp;both of the difficulties, Normal and Extreme in&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Legendary Battle - Thor: Love and Thunder. Acquire Bonus Rewards by completing different missions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997263983\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d2ef85c6e5694c7397086482cf05fe51_1656997263983_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997280947\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0e357d9cf57e4724aca9207e790805da_1656997280947_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The above list is the total amount of rewards that can be acquired by clearing all the Legendary Battle missions.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Addition of a Ranking System in Multiverse Invasion&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Test the ability of your heroes and find out where you rank in Multiverse Invasion.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. A new ranking system has been added to Multiverse Invasion.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; The total score you have acquired in the mode will be on display.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997587795\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d21f07fb2dd644769afe83ec2c6fcf27_1656997587795_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The rankings will be reset daily on 15:00 (UTC+0) / 8:00 (PDT).<br>\n* The results of a battle that started before 15:00 (UTC+0) / 8:00 (PDT) and&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;finished after the reset time will not be reflected in your rank.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- No ranking rewards will be given when your first Multiverse Invasion run of the day&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;finished after the reset time.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Acquire rewards on a daily basis according to your rank.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1657005794392\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2afb2460b01e478cb8ce9e260e2a4813_1657005794392_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* You can only acquire one type of reward.<br>\n* Rewards are sent to your Inbox as soon as the results are calculated&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;after the reset at 15:00 (UTC+0) / 8:00 (PDT).</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Giant Boss Raid Improvements</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">To help realize our wish for more Agents to enjoy the challenge of Dormammu,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">we have added a new function for your convenience and changed the balance of the battle.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Tips have been added on the Select Characters screen.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997649076\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4787e61db0ae4a64bd3390195bbacf66_1656997649076_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. A green arrow has been added to indicate a higher drop rate for certain items.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Three types of the Book of the Vishanti can be acquired due to the advancement of Thor to Tier-4: Combat, Blast, and Universal.<br>\n- A different type of the Book of the Vishanti can be acquired at a higher rate once per day.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Book of the Vishanti will still be available for you after acquiring the daily amount.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997676183\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7f05d914334f41e19c8f72bf783e3998_1656997676183_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The timer will no longer count down during the visual effect being displayed upon defeating Dormammu.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The issue of not being able to go to or return from the Mindless One on lower frame rates in Giant Boss Raid: Dormammu has been improved.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. Giant Boss Raid: Dormammu has been balanced.<br>\n- The pattern which removes all buffs has been deleted. (Except for summoning skills)<br>\n- Dormammu’s overall damage has increased by a small margin.</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive: New Collections and other Improvements</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check your progress effortlessly and check out your Instinct stat enhancements!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. In celebration of the July Update, 16 new S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Collections have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Normal and Event S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Collections have been separated.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997698265\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5fbbf45ac82b41af9419f64f6bc19c6f_1656997698265_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- 7th Anniversary Special Gift will be on the Event tab.<br>\n- The progress bar will display the percentage of your selected collection.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. All of the stats you can acquire through the S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive have been iconized.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Check out which Instinct stat you can acquire from each collection in the rewards list.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- View SHIELD Archive Effect has been improved so you can check your current progress relative to the total amount available.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997724565\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d8abae4554f544d08dc667c9157a00e3_1656997724565_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997741482\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e980448549ef4557b9130975801397b2_1656997741482_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. Incomplete S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Collection data will now be displayed on the content that they can be acquired.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997783821\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1ae8b6aa1af24b9eb7183a0011ef7872_1656997783821_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- To turn the function on and off, go to [Settings] &gt; [Option] &gt; [Display S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Reward].</span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. The Instinct stats acquired as S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Collection rewards have been buffed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Agents who have already received the stats will have the increased amount automatically applied.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. The S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Guide has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New passive Artifacts for Thor, Thor (Jane Foster), Valkyrie, Angela, Skurge, and Destroyer have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1657014329913\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/41cdaed72cb843a1837cfd9276a2dadb_1657014329913_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The effects in the description are based on 6★ Artifacts, passive skill Level 4.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Future Pass Season &amp; Special Icons</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new season of Future Pass will start after th</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">e update.<br>\nObtain various rewards along with Special Icons with the Future Pass.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[Future Pass Rewards]</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997826873\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a2b57d51626e440da0f3b0543960e315_1656997826873_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Please note that the Future Pass effects will apply upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Opened Legendary / Mythic Future Pass will only be applied during the season the Pass was purchased, and the Pass rewards will only be available during the same season.&nbsp;<br>\nPlease don’t forget to check the remaining event time!<br>\n- The Mythic Pass can only be purchased after purchasing the Legendary Pass.<br>\n- Legendary and Mythic Future Pass will not be available for purchase when the season is about to end. Please check the sales period in the game.</span><br>\n​<br>\nNew Special Icons have been added for our Agents!<br>\nTwo Special Icons from the Future Pass, one from the Legendary Battle, and one more from the upcoming events, are awaiting you!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[July Update New Special Icons]</strong></span><br>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-f88ec996-7fff-81f0-e60b-c3bb9cc62c88\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/dj5N7YFU2JocVh0oQF_GyLFkBQV_JTnt_cmesGG9BDLFbgSonlT18NA6GdqGYFkgn7wvnPG9msx2WKQvPeqwAzXoFuSdKdUVLPV1VHkZ82Hor6mZAkZDKq3vdPIg6H3hcoNlCBxN\" width=\"150\">&nbsp;</b><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-e44063a7-7fff-a461-3e2d-0f2f2e9d952d\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/IxYWr0ltaGU5ZTp-RSrNiiId4rrIqgSrQw4GZCxSrJt7GiBtLkbeZXx7LA1CcgcTABIjOMNiUxuct8Y6f3btdFVVzuzi5-2okcsrheq5EypJkkw9CJZRlPoQmU7N9P4HIyycpIXD\" width=\"150\"></b></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-b777362e-7fff-c804-ae62-b7a8654463c1\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/AvvBPwikJ7Ty2WTVU_UVxOd6uNxnNZlZ5FwUN4ooX8hnyTunV8NeViZXKc_0Kg6igBW_KSCTGjH7e8ue-YiGZPbweX9QYq5FMlqa0rmKpl2viuGzh6aXBwAN6U454a6QXXl39A-U\" width=\"150\"></b>&nbsp;<b id=\"docs-internal-guid-a0d5b0ff-7fff-d4f4-d80e-2e3b297c1727\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/n9fWHLkKk7GvWE92_DJjrEsMkFLB1Qng5oppN3mHj9QiWXRo3GYZNsGhmRE9RDhpW8AdDw_2hbP0ouwVDceUeDVr2c-00He8nwcWPwDIaAm8C1jIaafYmrPs-TtPoX-ALrpfS4CE\" width=\"150\"></b></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ One New Uniform Collection</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new Uniforms from the July Update!<br>\nComplete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn a reward.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997940495\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/968087336e104f79906c8b86eda6ad0f_1656997940495_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Information on Mighty and Brilliant C.T.P.s have been added to the Custom Gear List in MARVEL Universe.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997965064\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bb552940318c45f18e2600eaed8fb190_1656997965064_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Leader and Ultimate skills can be checked on the Changed Skills tab in a hero’s Uniform List screen if they are changed by equipping a uniform.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656997980033\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a6d47f0c35224829a1181e73baa650e3_1656997980033_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The effect of removing every buff from your hero in certain patterns has been changed to removing all the summoning skills in World Boss Legend: Infinity Ultron.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The issue of Dimension Rift availability being refreshed only when logging into the game or entering the Dimension Rift menu has been fixed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The availability of Dimension Rifts are updated upon entering the main lobby screen.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. Details on Level 10 skills for Tier-4 heroes can now be checked in the MARVEL Universe.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. You can now delete your account yourself by tapping on&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; [Settings] &gt; [Account] &gt; [Delete Game Account].&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* For further assistance, please contact Customer Support.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[7/7 (Thu) 7:40&nbsp;(UTC+0), 7/7 (Thu) 00:40 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Additional information regarding the deletion of accounts have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶ Upon your deletion request, all your information regarding Rankings and Friends are deleted&nbsp;</span></font></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; and cannot be restored.</span></font></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶ 30 days after the grace period, data regarding your game account are deleted from the game&nbsp;</span></font></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; and cannot be restored.</span></font></span></p>\n\n<p><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶ Login to the game with the pending account to withdraw your request.</span></font></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">7. The issues of intermittent loss of Alliance Chat logs and not being able to properly access the Alliance Chat logs has been improved.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">8. Artifact and S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive Guides have been added to the ‘Is the mission too difficult?’ pop up screen.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">9. Changes have been made to the Card Crafting Cube reward in Dimension Rift.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- An additional Dimension Rift Daily Progress Completion Reward has been added. The amount of Card Crafting Cubes and C.T.P. Reforging Cores that you can acquire from a single Dimension Rift run has&nbsp;been adjusted.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1657008033344\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1dded036a3fc41fcafbb785545ac8376_1657008033344_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The issue of quests not completing upon upgrading certain heroes with tickets has been fixed.<br>\n2. The issue of flame effects being displayed unnaturally for the Inferno &lt;Modern&gt; uniform on certain skills has been fixed.<br>\n3. The issue of C.T.P. of Insight’s effect being applied to other participants on Co-op modes has been fixed.<br>\n4. The issue of the S.H.I.E.L.D. Archive collection effects not being applied properly on certain contents has been fixed.&nbsp;<br>\n5. The issue of some skills not being displayed properly in the Skill Preview has been fixed.<br>\n6. The issue of vibration alarm notifying the end of Auto-Repeat not working in Multiverse Invasion has been fixed.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nWe will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1656996766389\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6de065096c6a47bdaa7452aca294db81_1656996766389_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}